^Kubernetes e2e suite (\[sig-scheduling\] SchedulerPredicates validates resource limits of pods that are allowed to run \[Conformance\] \[Serial\]|\[sig-api-machinery\] AdmissionWebhook \[Privileged:ClusterAdmin\] should reject validating webhook configurations with invalid match conditions \[Conformance\]|\[sig-api-machinery\] FieldValidation should detect unknown metadata fields in both the root and embedded object of a CR \[Conformance\]|\[sig-api-machinery\] Watchers should be able to start watching from a specific resource version \[Conformance\]|\[sig-apps\] Job should run a job to completion when tasks sometimes fail and are locally restarted \[Conformance\]|\[sig-auth\] Projected PodCertificate \[FeatureGate:PodCertificateRequest\] \[FeatureGate:ClusterTrustBundle\] \[FeatureGate:ClusterTrustBundleProjection\] should allow server and client pods to establish an mTLS connection \[MinimumKubeletVersion:1\.37\] \[Conformance\]|\[sig-cli\] Kubectl client Kubectl version should check is all data is printed \[Conformance\]|\[sig-network\] Networking Granular Checks: Pods should function for intra-pod communication: http \[Conformance\] \[NodeConformance\]|\[sig-node\] Container Lifecycle Hook when create a pod with lifecycle hook should execute poststart http hook properly \[Conformance\] \[NodeConformance\]|\[sig-node\] Node Lifecycle should run through the lifecycle of a node \[Conformance\]|\[sig-node\] RuntimeClass should reject a Pod requesting a deleted RuntimeClass \[Conformance\] \[NodeConformance\]|\[sig-scheduling\] LimitRange should list, patch and delete a LimitRange by collection \[Conformance\]|\[sig-storage\] EmptyDir volumes should support \(non-root,0777,default\) \[LinuxOnly\] \[Conformance\] \[NodeConformance\]|\[sig-storage\] Projected downwardAPI should update annotations on modification \[Conformance\] \[NodeConformance\])$
